  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "EDA電子設計自動化技術與實作",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONIC DESIGN AUTOMATION TECHNOLOGY AND IMPLEMENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講述電子設計自動化 (Electronic Design Automation, EDA) 基本概念、應用、產業技術以及所需要的開發技術。如EDA如何協助IC設計及半導體製造，各個流程中用到的工具，目前產業生態。除此之外，對於有興趣從事這方面的學生，提供所應具備的技能教學。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the basic concepts, applications, industrial technologies and required development technologies of Electronic Design Automation (EDA). For example; how EDA assists IC design and semiconductor manufacturing, the tools used in each process and the current industry ecosystem. In addition, necessary skills teaching would be provided to students who are interested in this field.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
